CORE
main.cob
--function MAINPGM
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
Whole-program CALL linkage: a CALL to a same-file program defined earlier is
linked by copying the USING argument into the callee's LINKAGE formal,
invoking the callee, and copying a BY REFERENCE formal back. IBM LR "CALL
statement". See doc/architectural/cobol-call-linkage.md.
